{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43503","headline":"白受采 · 无名氏","name":"白受采","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"皛皛金方色，迁移妙不穷。\n轻衣尘迹化，净壁缋文通。\n沙变蓝溪渍，冰渝墨沼空。\n似甘言受和，由礼学资忠。\n皎洁形无定，玄黄用莫同。\n素心如可教，愿染古人风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43503.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43503","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}